       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "accordion",
      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "»elephant 2.0« – 操作极其简单",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<ol><li>选择<strong>刀具类型</strong>，例如：圆柱铣刀 &gt; 带圆角的圆柱铣刀</li><li>选择所需<strong>参数</strong></li><li>执行<strong>测量</strong>，例如有效轮廓圆角</li><li><strong>测量结果</strong>（19项，全自动测量，无需数据输入/编程）</li></ol>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/8/csm_software_elephant_3788f74653.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 556
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1527",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»expert« — 智能、简便、卓越",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>»expert« 是精密刀具测量领域的专家 — 基于 ZOLLER »pilot 4.0« 软件。这款智能软件能根据所选参数生成最优的测量流程。全自动、可重复，并具备逼真的参数选择界面。 通过复选框，可轻松、快速且针对具体刀具为测量程序流程选择待测参数。只需选择待测参数并确认— 测量流程即刻启动。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_software_expert_debaec8152.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c1525",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "»skp« — 个性化、安全、精准",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>为实现最佳刀具寿命以及高效、精准的切削性能，刀具刃口的精确制备至关重要。在此过程中，刃口制备的控制、优化及其可靠详细的记录，正发挥着越来越重要的作用。ZOLLER »titan« 配备 CNC 控制的可摆动测量传感器 »zep« 及 »skp« 软件，可快速、非接触、全自动地测量各种刃口制备形式。</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/a/csm_software_skp_8041fbb2c6.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1024,
            "h": 606
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c2349",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "accordion",
      "id": "c1529",
